    "note": "The summit sits within the Crystal Mountain ski area. Willhite's route is the summer gondola to the ridge, then a walk to the high point north of the Summit House. He says the gondola route works in summer, which is the basis for 'restricted' (seasonal). No source states the resort's access policy."
